UID:VABfjVd0dq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nIn this Blaxploitation classic\, 
 African prince Mamuwalde visits Count Dracula to seek help ending the slav
 e trade but is instead bitten and cursed to live eternally as a vampire—
 Blacula.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/blacula\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 1:45
